$date 2026-09-29 $end
$version transistor-lut vcd.py $end
$comment logic values (threshold VDD/2) and node voltages from ngspice $end
$timescale 1ps $end
$scope module lut2_tgate $end
$var wire 1 ! a $end
$var wire 1 " b $end
$var wire 1 # y $end
$var wire 4 $ table [3:0] $end
$var wire 2 % index [1:0] $end
$var real 64 & v_a $end
$var real 64 ' v_b $end
$var real 64 ( v_n0 $end
$var real 64 ) v_n1 $end
$var real 64 * v_yi $end
$var real 64 + v_yb $end
$var real 64 , v_y $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
